{"id":"77b08debbb908b92","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-circuit-model.md","title":"有限布尔电路的结构与求值","display":"df-circuit-model — 有限布尔电路的结构与求值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-circuit-model","aliases":["29-df-circuit-model"],"display":"df-circuit-model — 有限布尔电路的结构与求值","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-circuit-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-circuit-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-model — 有限布尔电路的结构与求值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]=\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}\">\\([N]=\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}\\)</span>；下面九个一元标签、三个二元符号与输出常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 两两不同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinOrd}\\)</span> 为严格线序，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=|C|\">\\(V=|C|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=|V|\">\\(m=|V|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\">\\(\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\)</span> 的序列按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,r\">\\(0,\\ldots,r\\)</span> 编号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 从前驱门指向使用它的门；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 只用于输入编号和阈值编码，不要求是拓扑序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 是九个门标签的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\\notin\\mathcal T\">\\(\\dagger\\notin\\mathcal T\\)</span> 为非法标签值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_C(v)\">\\(\\lambda_C(v)\\)</span> 对所有候选结构有定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 的初始段编码阈值，取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 至扇入加一；后一个值统一代表恒假阈值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbb B^N\">\\(w\\in\\mathbb B^N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in V\">\\(v\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_P\">\\(\\mathbf1_P\\)</span> 是命题示性值，空积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一满足条件的对象。常量门不是输入位置，也不属于受基集约束的内部门。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1,\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT},\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\},\\qquad\\tau_c\\coloneqq\\langle E^{(2)},\\prec^{(2)},K^{(2)},\\mathrm{IN}^{(1)},\\mathrm{CONST}_0^{(1)},\\mathrm{CONST}_1^{(1)},\\mathrm{AND}_2^{(1)},\\mathrm{OR}_2^{(1)},\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega^{(1)},\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega^{(1)},\\mathrm{NOT}^{(1)},\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega^{(1)},o\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1,\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT},\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\},\\qquad\\tau_c\\coloneqq\\langle E^{(2)},\\prec^{(2)},K^{(2)},\\mathrm{IN}^{(1)},\\mathrm{CONST}_0^{(1)},\\mathrm{CONST}_1^{(1)},\\mathrm{AND}_2^{(1)},\\mathrm{OR}_2^{(1)},\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega^{(1)},\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega^{(1)},\\mathrm{NOT}^{(1)},\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega^{(1)},o\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E^C\\},\\quad d_C(v)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)|,\\quad K_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(v,u)\\in K^C\\},\\quad\\kappa_C(v)\\coloneqq|K_C(v)|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E^C\\},\\quad d_C(v)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)|,\\quad K_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(v,u)\\in K^C\\},\\quad\\kappa_C(v)\\coloneqq|K_C(v)|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\coloneqq\\{(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in V^{r+1}:\\forall i\\in[r]\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^C\\},\\quad\\operatorname{DAG}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall r\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\forall\\bar v\\in\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\;v_0\\neq v_r.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\coloneqq\\{(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in V^{r+1}:\\forall i\\in[r]\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^C\\},\\quad\\operatorname{DAG}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall r\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\forall\\bar v\\in\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\;v_0\\neq v_r.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Partition}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bigcup_{T\\in\\mathcal T}T^C=V\\land\\forall T,T&#39;\\in\\mathcal T\\;(T\\neq T&#39;\\to T^C\\cap T&#39;^C=\\varnothing),\\qquad\\lambda_C(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\iota T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(v\\in T^C),&amp;\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal T\\;v\\in T^C,\\\\\\dagger,&amp;\\neg\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal T\\;v\\in T^C.\\end{cases}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Partition}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bigcup_{T\\in\\mathcal T}T^C=V\\land\\forall T,T&#39;\\in\\mathcal T\\;(T\\neq T&#39;\\to T^C\\cap T&#39;^C=\\varnothing),\\qquad\\lambda_C(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\iota T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(v\\in T^C),&amp;\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal T\\;v\\in T^C,\\\\\\dagger,&amp;\\neg\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal T\\;v\\in T^C.\\end{cases}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\\coloneqq\\left\\{C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\operatorname{Partition}(C)\\land\\operatorname{DAG}(C)\\land\\prec^C\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|C|)\\land|\\mathrm{IN}^C|=N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}\\to d_C(v)=0)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2\\}\\to d_C(v)=2)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{NOT}\\to d_C(v)=1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\lambda_C(v)\\neq\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\to K_C(v)=\\varnothing)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\to\\kappa_C(v)\\leq d_C(v)+1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v,u,u&#39;\\in V\\;\\bigl(u\\in K_C(v)\\land(u&#39;,u)\\in\\prec^C\\to u&#39;\\in K_C(v)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\\coloneqq\\left\\{C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\operatorname{Partition}(C)\\land\\operatorname{DAG}(C)\\land\\prec^C\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|C|)\\land|\\mathrm{IN}^C|=N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}\\to d_C(v)=0)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2\\}\\to d_C(v)=2)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{NOT}\\to d_C(v)=1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\lambda_C(v)\\neq\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\to K_C(v)=\\varnothing)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\to\\kappa_C(v)\\leq d_C(v)+1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v,u,u&#39;\\in V\\;\\bigl(u\\in K_C(v)\\land(u&#39;,u)\\in\\prec^C\\to u&#39;\\in K_C(v)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C\\coloneqq\\iota f:[N]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathrm{IN}^C\\;\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in[N]\\;(i&lt;j\\leftrightarrow(f(i),f(j))\\in\\prec^C)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota_C\\coloneqq\\iota f:[N]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathrm{IN}^C\\;\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in[N]\\;(i&lt;j\\leftrightarrow(f(i),f(j))\\in\\prec^C)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq m,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\coloneqq\\max\\{r\\in[m]:\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\neq\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Gates}(C)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda_C(v):v\\in V\\}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq m,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\coloneqq\\max\\{r\\in[m]:\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\neq\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Gates}(C)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda_C(v):v\\in V\\}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_{C,w}^{0}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(\\iota_C^{-1}(v)),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{IN},\\\\1,&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{CONST}_1,\\\\0,&amp;\\lambda_C(v)\\notin\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_{C,w}^{0}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(\\iota_C^{-1}(v)),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{IN},\\\\1,&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{CONST}_1,\\\\0,&amp;\\lambda_C(v)\\notin\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_{C,w}^{j+1}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nw(\\iota_C^{-1}(v)),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{IN},\\\\\nb,&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{CONST}_b\\ (b\\in\\mathbb B),\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)}v_{C,w}^{j}(u),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{v_{C,w}^{j}(u):u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)\\}),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega\\},\\\\\n1-\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)}v_{C,w}^{j}(u),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{NOT},\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)}v_{C,w}^{j}(u)\\geq\\kappa_C(v)},&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_{C,w}^{j+1}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nw(\\iota_C^{-1}(v)),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{IN},\\\\\nb,&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{CONST}_b\\ (b\\in\\mathbb B),\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)}v_{C,w}^{j}(u),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{v_{C,w}^{j}(u):u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)\\}),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega\\},\\\\\n1-\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)}v_{C,w}^{j}(u),&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{NOT},\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)}v_{C,w}^{j}(u)\\geq\\kappa_C(v)},&amp;\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}(C,w)\\coloneqq v_{C,w}^{m}(o^C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eval}(C,w)\\coloneqq v_{C,w}^{m}(o^C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐原电路类实际调用而此前仅称为外部原语的接口。电路本身就是有限词汇结构，因而一阶查询输出与电路的等号没有编码类型缺口。常量门处理零输入及常量函数；阈值截断不改变任何门的布尔函数。门序不附加拓扑排序要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$，$N\\in\\mathbb N$，$[N]=\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}$；下面九个一元标签、三个二元符号与输出常量 $o$ 两两不同。$\\mathrm{LinOrd}$ 为严格线序，见 [[29-df-ordering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[N]=\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]","display":false},{"tex":"V=|C|","display":false},{"tex":"m=|V|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,r","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger\\notin\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_C(v)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbb B^N","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_P","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1,\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT},\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\},\\qquad\\tau_c\\coloneqq\\langle E^{(2)},\\prec^{(2)},K^{(2)},\\mathrm{IN}^{(1)},\\mathrm{CONST}_0^{(1)},\\mathrm{CONST}_1^{(1)},\\mathrm{AND}_2^{(1)},\\mathrm{OR}_2^{(1)},\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega^{(1)},\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega^{(1)},\\mathrm{NOT}^{(1)},\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega^{(1)},o\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E^C\\},\\quad d_C(v)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Pred}_C(v)|,\\quad K_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(v,u)\\in K^C\\},\\quad\\kappa_C(v)\\coloneqq|K_C(v)|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\coloneqq\\{(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in V^{r+1}:\\forall i\\in[r]\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^C\\},\\quad\\operatorname{DAG}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall r\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\forall\\bar v\\in\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\;v_0\\neq v_r.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Partition}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bigcup_{T\\in\\mathcal T}T^C=V\\land\\forall T,T'\\in\\mathcal T\\;(T\\neq T'\\to T^C\\cap T'^C=\\varnothing),\\qquad\\lambda_C(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\iota T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(v\\in T^C),&\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal T\\;v\\in T^C,\\\\\\dagger,&\\neg\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal T\\;v\\in T^C.\\end{cases}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\\coloneqq\\left\\{C\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&\\operatorname{Partition}(C)\\land\\operatorname{DAG}(C)\\land\\prec^C\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|C|)\\land|\\mathrm{IN}^C|=N\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{IN},\\mathrm{CONST}_0,\\mathrm{CONST}_1\\}\\to d_C(v)=0)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)\\in\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2\\}\\to d_C(v)=2)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{NOT}\\to d_C(v)=1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\lambda_C(v)\\neq\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\to K_C(v)=\\varnothing)\\land(\\lambda_C(v)=\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega\\to\\kappa_C(v)\\leq d_C(v)+1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v,u,u'\\in V\\;\\bigl(u\\in K_C(v)\\land(u',u)\\in\\prec^C\\to u'\\in K_C(v)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_C\\coloneqq\\iota f:[N]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathrm{IN}^C\\;\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in[N]\\;(i<j\\leftrightarrow(f(i),f(j))\\in\\prec^C)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq m,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\coloneqq\\max\\{r\\in[m]:\\operatorname{Path}_C(r)\\neq\\varnothing